{"pageid":1190,"title":"Secret Shack","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Secret Shack</span>","revid":7553,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2d/Secret_Shack_New_Map.png/revision/latest?cb=20230828165648\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Secret Shack New Map\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2d/Secret_Shack_New_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/407?cb=20230828165648\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"407\" height=\"239\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Secret Shack New Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Secret_Shack_New_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Secret Shack can be accessed by climbing one of the spikes located in <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Wastes\" title=\"Acid Wastes\">Acid Wastes</a> biome.\n</p><p>Touching it results in obtaining the \"⬟ A Familiar Place\" badge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Secret Shack is a small booth with a shelf, a kicked down door, a rusted golden axe, and a shriveled up potted cacti housed inside. Before the map revamp, it also contained a rubber duckie nearby. It was once located on the <a href=\"/wiki/Familiar_Island\" title=\"Familiar Island\">Familiar Island</a>, but after the map revamp, it got impaled atop one of the spikes in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Wastes\" title=\"Acid Wastes\">Acid Wastes</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This shack is a reference to the previous Typical Developers project called Woodmill Inc.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px;